‡E apolause pou pairnoume apo ena metaphusiko sustema, e eukharistese pou mas dinei e noetike organose tou kosmou se ena austera themeliomeno, enteles kai isorropo oikodomema skepses, einai pantote kai pano ap' ola aisthetikes phuseos. Ekhei ten idia pege me te khara, ten upsele kai anotere eudaimonia pou mas kharizei e tekhne me te duname pou diathetei na morphopoiei kai na taxinomei to uliko tes, na bazei se taxe tis sugkekhumenes katastaseis tes zoes, etsi oste na mas prospherei kathare kai katholike thea. [...]"Œ

‰
Den etan pano apo diakosioi katoikoi kai zousan polu duskola apo te thalassa, kollemenoi sto brakho tous san elithia peismatika malakia. Kai pano apo tis athlies steges, skammenes kathe kheimona apo ta kumata, phainotan mono e ekklesia pros ta dexia, loxa pano sta brakhia, kai aristera to spiti ton Santo me to dromo ste mese na ta khorizei. Ekei briskotan ole e Mponbil...
S' auto to skeniko topothetei o Zola tous kharakteres tou kai stenei to pio skoteino kai peritekhno drama tou. Ki an o titlos autou tou skhedon agnostou sto elleniko koino aristourgematos akougetai eironikos, ekei brisketai to talento tou koruphaiou ekprosopou tou natouralismou: mesa apo ten apaisiodoxia, ten pikria kai to phobo tou thanatou, umnountai e agape kai e dipsa tou anthropou gia zoe.
"Sten pikre eironeia tes Kharas tes zoes, o Emil Zola perikleiei me thaumatourgo tropo ole ten anthropoteta, graphei me megaleio ten istoria mias sunethismenes astikes oikogeneias, sten opoia oi dustukhies tes zoes ekhoun os skeniko te thalassa, ten agria thalassa, opos e zoe aneleete, san ki ekeine akouraste, pou rokanizei siga siga ena mikro psarokhori khtismeno sten kardia kapoias apokremnes aktes.
Kai pano ap ole aute ten istoria planatai to mauro pouli me t' aplomena phtera: o thanatos." (Gku nte Mopassan)"

Š
"To dogma tou sok" einai ena apo ta elakhista biblia pou mas boethoun na katalaboume to paron, kathos apotelei ten pio olokleromene analuse tes sugkalummenes istorias tes epokhes mas. Mia sunarpastike perigraphe tes neas pagkosmias taxes, pou brisketai se katastase amok. E analuse tou kapitalismou tes katastrophes epikheireitai apo ten Klain me teleia diulismene orge, pou diokheteuetai mesa apo adiaseista dedomena. Se aute ten protoporiake enallaktike istoria tes pleon kuriarkhes ideologias tes epokhes mas, tes oikonomikes epanastases ton eleutheron agoron tou Milton Phrintman, e Naomi Klain amphisbetei to diadedomeno mutho oti e pagkosmia nike tou neophileleutherou kinematos uperxe eirenike. Katadeiknuei oti, apo te Khile tou 1973 mekhri to semerino Irak, o Phrintman kai oi uposteriktes tou ekmetalleutekan epaneilemmena te bia kai mia seira apo tromaktika sok gia na epibaloun tis akraies politikes tous.
Apokaluptei ten entuposiake omoioteta anamesa stis anakritikes tekhnikes tes CIA kai stis ekbiastikes tekhnikes tes Pagkosmias Trapezas kai tou DNT, sten prospatheia tous na epibaloun ton kapitalismo tes katastrophes se oloklero ton kosmo.
Ena exairetiko biblio, ikano na prokalesei tsounami ntropes -alla kai politikes drases, gia na stamatesei epitelous e therapeia-sok."£
 Tyler's been around a lot longer than anyone realized . . . To gain admittance to the current generation of Project Mayhem, Marla is more than happy to provide Sebastian with plenty of bruises, and thus, the search for their son begins . . .
*One of IGN and io9's Most Anticipated Comics of 2015!
"Ever wanted to know what happened to the anonymous narrator--and his constant companion, Tyler Durden--of Fight Club? Thanks to writer Chuck Palahniuk, artist Cameron Stewart and Dark Horse Comics, you'll get the answer in Fight Club 2."--Playboy"¨
¥This bundle contains all seven volumes of Frank Miller's landmark Sin City, the hard-boiled stories that started it all! The books that inspired the critically-acclaimed film, the now-infamous Marv, Dwight, Gail, Miho, Hartigan, Nancy, and theYellow Bastard will transport you to Sin City and show you the bloody lives they lead ... bloody by choice or by circumstance. Frank Miller's Sin City is a triumph for its fiercely independent creator, and has been honored with Eisner awards, Harvey awards, and the prestigious National Cartoonists' Award."Â
¿Auto to proto khronologika muthistorema tou Mopasan einai epereasmeno apo to realismo tou Phlomper. Kathe anthropos tha gnorisei khares alla kai perissoteres lupes. E zoe tes eroidas, pou arkhizei me tose aisiodoxia, gregora tha phortistei me apogoeteuseis kai thlipseis. Plesiazontas pros to terma tes tha proseggisei ten apognose. Ki ostoso aute te stigme duo gegonota tha tes pheroun aprosdokete khara. E antapodose tes kalosunes apo mia adikemene kopela ki e gennese enos neou anthropou tha tes dosoun te duname kai ten epithumia na zesei mia kainouria aisiodoxia. "Mia zoe den einai oute toso kale oute toso kake oso pisteuoun", tha katalexei sumperasmatika enas apo tous eroes tou muthistorematos."Å
ÂSince he was discharged from the mental hospital, Sebastian has been a do-nothing cog in the world's largest military-industrial corporation: Rize or Die. Marla searches for clues among the various clubs that have spun off of Tyler's original fight clubs, and she discovers that Project Mayhem is not a boys-only enterprise--not anymore.
* Chuck Palahniuk writes the sequel to Fight Club!
"At turns deeply poignant and very funny, Palahniuk's freakish fables capture a twisted zeitgeist and add an oddly inspirational and subversive voice to the contemporary canon.... In the post-9/11 present, a hyperactive, Internet-obsessed, war- and recession-weary America apparently needs Tyler again."--The Atlantic"Ë	
È	A Frequency Dictionary of Frenchis an invaluable tool for all learners of French, providing a list of the 5000 most frequently used words in the language.
Based on a 23-million-word corpus of French which includes written and spoken material both from France and overseas, this dictionary provides the user with detailed information for each of the 5000 entries, including English equivalents, a sample sentence, its English translation, usage statistics, and an indication of register variation.
Users can access the top 5000 words either through the main frequency listing or through an alphabetical index. Throughout the frequency listing there are thematically-organized lists of the top words from a variety of key topics such as sports, weather, clothing, and family terms.
An engaging and highly useful resource, the Frequency Dictionary of French will enable students of all levels to get the most out of their study of French vocabulary.
Deryle Lonsdaleis Associate Professor in the Linguistics and English Language Department at Brigham Young University (Provo, Utah). Yvon Le Brasis Associate Professor of French and Department Chair of the French and Italian Department at Brigham Young University (Provo, Utah)."İ
ÚThe Explosive Finale!
The most highly anticipated comics series of the year ends in the biggest way possible--the whole world burns away according to Tyler's plan, and a new one he never anticipated is conceived. The meek inherit the Earth, and a final showdown proves that, finally, Roland Barthes is right!
* Chuck Palahniuk writes the sequel to Fight Club!
"Full of more surprises than a Cracker Jack box, it's a great expansion of an already strange universe."--Fangoria"ù
öE philia tou Gkampriel kai tou Luk etan epikentromene stis gunaikes kai sto musterio tous. Eno o Gkampriel den arkhize mia peripeteia dikhos, tautokhrona, na epidiokei mia alle, o Luk xekinouse panta ena desmo me to monimo phobo men teleiosei polu suntoma. O protos edine ta panta gia tous thriambous tou krebatiou pou apaitoun mia kapoia ugeia kai polle psukhraimia* o deuteros upetasse tis mataiotetes tou erotismou sten kuriarkhia tou aisthematos. E aionia suzetese metaxu tous: Gkampriel: "Den uparkhei oraiotero pragma apo to na dineis edone se mia agnoste philontas to ugro kai gluko phulo tes". Luk: "To akron aoton tes eutukhias einai na anapauesai sten agkalia tes agapemenes sou". Geloia suzetese: o Gkampriel etan eroteumenos m' ekeine ten xene pou e prophora tes ton xetrelaine, eno o Luk eikhe mplekhtei se mia peripeteia dikhos mellon me mia neare kopela pou den agapouse alla pou den katapherne na khorisei. Te stigme pou oi duo philoi apophasizoun na paroun tis apostaseis tous o enas ap' ton allo, th' anakalupsoun xaphnika pos einai omoioi e, akoma kheirotero, enallaximoi. (APO TEN PAROUSIASE STO OPISThOPhULLO TOU BIBLIOU)"␀␀P@"␀␀ˆ@"	)\Âõ(@"	R¸…ëQ@"	q=
